    /// Disallow the use of `eval()`-like functions.
    ///
    /// Passing a string to the timer functions `setTimeout`, `setInterval`, or
    /// `setImmediate` causes the string to be evaluated as _JavaScript_ code,
    /// which is a form of implied `eval()`.
    ///
    /// Using implied `eval()` exposes the same
